        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "上一段讲到「全卷积网络」。现在把镜头转向「U-Net」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：研究者为什么需要「U-Net」？当时已有的方法究竟卡在了哪里？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "生物医学图像需要模型在有限标注下学习，并保留细小结构。普通分类 CNN 不够，因为输出必须与每个像素对齐。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-u-net-convolutional-networks-for-biomedical-image-segmentation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "U-Net 将收集上下文的路径与恢复分辨率的路径配对。跳跃连接把语义上下文与局部细节重新合在一起。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-u-net-convolutional-networks-for-biomedical-image-segmentation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 U-Net 视为密集预测和图像复原的经典架构。它的长期影响在于带跳跃连接的编码器-解码器模式，从生物医学分割扩展到图像复原、生成模型和扩散模型骨干网络。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-u-net-convolutional-networks-for-biomedical-image-segmentation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "这条线索还没有结束。接下来来到「LSTM 与门控记忆」，我们会看到研究者怎样把问题继续向前推进。",
